# W9 r2-r3: a prompt steered into the first turn asks for the session's title
# at its own keystroke, as fx's steer is admitted through the same
# `snapshotPrompt` (src/main.zig:1407-1420, :1479-1481). The title request is
# refused (500) each time, so no title comes back and the gate stays open:
# the first prompt asks, the steer typed while the first answer is held open
# asks again. Then `/trace`, whose `## Session Title` says how the last
# question went.
gateway titles-steer-turns.json
titled titles-refused.json
seed titles-seed.json
xfx: env XFX_SOUND=off
wait 3
type fix the renderer loop
key Enter
wait 1.5
type make it faster too
key Enter
wait 8
snap steered
title steered
type /trace
wait 0.5
key Enter
wait 2
snap trace
reports report
gwlog
